    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exceptional opportunity to secure one of the final apartment available at Haley's Hill. Move in ready, The Pine is a beautifully designed 1-bedroom own-door apartment that is eligible  for both the Help to Buy (HTB) and First Home Scheme (FHS), helping purchasers take their first step onto the property ladder.\r\n \r\nExtending to approximately 58.3 sq.m, this bright these spacious homes have been thoughtfully designed to maximise comfort, functionality and natural light. Finished to a high standard throughout, The Pine is ideally suited to first time buyers, downsizers or anyone seeking a stylish, low-maintenance home in a superb location.\r\n \r\nWith a private outdoor terrace and a designated parking space, the Pines offer comfort and convenience to home owners.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned just minutes from Malahide, Portmarnock residents can enjoy the best of coastal and city living with a wealth of amenities on their doorstep.\r\n \r\nHaley’s Hill offers excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond. Residents can enjoy easy access to the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport, while Portmarnock DART Station is just a short drive away and benefits from a dedicated commuter park-and-ride facility, making daily travel both convenient and stress-free\r\n \r\nTo arrange a viewing or learn more about The Pine apartment please contact our sales team."
      },
